{'symbol': 'EBAY', 'date': '2021-07-13 16:12:00', 'title': 'EBAY INC. REPORTS KOREA BUSINESSES AS DISCONTINUED OPERATIONS AND RELEASES UPDATED HISTORICAL FINANCIALS', 'text': "SAN JOSE, CALIF., JULY 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DURING THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2021, EBAY INC. (NASDAQ: EBAY) AND EMART ANNOUNCED THEY REACHED AN AGREEMENT FOR THE PURCHASE BY EMART OF EBAY'S BUSINESSES IN KOREA AND DETERMINED THAT IT MET THE CRITERIA FOR THE CLASSIFICATION OF HELD-FOR-SALE ACCOUNTING AND DISCONTINUED OPERATIONS."}